WEBVTT

00:00:04.825 --> 00:00:05.869
[GRUNTS]

00:00:05.913 --> 00:00:07.044
Ah!

00:00:07.349 --> 00:00:08.568
[SNARLS]

00:00:12.093 --> 00:00:13.181
Hmm. Huh?

00:00:15.401 --> 00:00:16.532
[GROWLS]

00:00:19.144 --> 00:00:20.188
[WHIMPERS]

00:00:20.232 --> 00:00:22.147
Whoa, whoa, whoa...

00:00:22.190 --> 00:00:23.583
[WHOOPING]

00:00:24.236 --> 00:00:25.585
[SCREAMS]
那老虎是怎么飞的

00:00:25.628 --> 00:00:28.501
So, how did
the tiger fly?
那老虎是怎么飞的

00:00:28.544 --> 00:00:30.503
She jumped
on the sun...
她跳上了太阳

00:00:30.546 --> 00:00:32.287
and rode it
to Tomorrow.
骑着太阳到达明天

00:00:32.331 --> 00:00:33.680
EEP: Oh...

00:00:33.723 --> 00:00:36.204
[GRUNTS] No, no, no.
[TIGER SCREECHES IN PAIN]
不 你们不准这样

00:00:37.597 --> 00:00:38.641
Ha!

00:00:38.685 --> 00:00:39.947
[YOWLS]

00:00:39.990 --> 00:00:40.991
Ah!

00:00:44.473 --> 00:00:45.909
[GASPING ANXIOUSLY]

00:00:47.520 --> 00:00:48.651
[SCREAMS]

00:00:56.224 --> 00:00:57.660
[GASPING ANXIOUSLY]

00:00:57.704 --> 00:00:58.705
Ah!

00:01:00.533 --> 00:01:01.969
[ALL WHOOPING]

00:01:03.275 --> 00:01:04.406
[GASPING]

00:01:08.889 --> 00:01:09.890
Hi, Dad!
老爸 你好

00:01:11.239 --> 00:01:12.849
Bye, Dad!
老爸 再见

00:01:16.592 --> 00:01:17.637
[GROANING]

00:01:17.680 --> 00:01:20.335
You've seen
rain before, right?
你们看过雨吧

00:01:20.379 --> 00:01:22.598
We don't get out much.
我们那里很少下雨

00:01:28.865 --> 00:01:30.432
[THUNDER RUMBLING]
[GASPS]

00:01:34.784 --> 00:01:35.916
[GRUNTS]

00:01:40.137 --> 00:01:41.443
[THUNK LAUGHING]

00:01:43.706 --> 00:01:46.100
Eep, looks dangerous.
[GROANS]
一妹 这看起来很危险

00:01:46.143 --> 00:01:48.537
Dad, you say that
about everything.
老爸 你什么都说很危险

00:01:48.581 --> 00:01:49.712
Careful.
Oh.
小心点

00:01:49.756 --> 00:01:51.105
Really? Okay.
真的吗 好吧

00:01:51.148 --> 00:01:52.237
[GASPS]

00:01:54.804 --> 00:01:56.023
[GIGGLES]

00:02:00.201 --> 00:02:01.376
[GASPING]

00:02:08.818 --> 00:02:10.124
[ALL WHOOPING]

00:02:20.003 --> 00:02:21.091
[SPLASHES]

00:02:23.311 --> 00:02:25.182
Whoa!
[LAUGHING]
不 不行...这样不好...

00:02:25.226 --> 00:02:28.229
No, no, no.
Not cool!
不 不行...这样不好...

00:02:28.273 --> 00:02:29.491
[GRUNTS]

00:02:30.362 --> 00:02:31.450
[GASPS]

00:02:34.366 --> 00:02:35.497
[GRUNTS]

00:02:36.324 --> 00:02:37.760
[SPLASHING]

00:02:40.807 --> 00:02:42.199
[MUFFLED SCREAMS]

00:02:48.554 --> 00:02:50.730
So, the bear says,
"Your cave?
所以熊说:「你的洞穴

00:02:50.773 --> 00:02:52.601
"I've been dumping
my bones here
since last week."
我上礼拜就开始丢骨头进去了」

00:02:52.645 --> 00:02:53.776
Last week!
[ALL LAUGHING]
上礼拜

00:02:54.690 --> 00:02:56.344
That's a funny story!
这个故事太好笑了

00:02:56.388 --> 00:02:58.607
It's not a story.
It's a joke.
这不是故事 是笑话

00:02:58.651 --> 00:03:00.043
What's a "joke"?
什么是「笑话」

00:03:00.087 --> 00:03:03.308
Just making something up
to make you laugh.
就是捏造出来让你笑的

00:03:03.351 --> 00:03:04.613
[GRAN LAUGHING]

00:03:08.356 --> 00:03:09.618
GUY: One for you.
Thanks.
一个给你 -谢谢

00:03:09.662 --> 00:03:12.665
One for you.
And this one's for you.
一个给你 这是你的

00:03:12.708 --> 00:03:14.449
[ALL PLAYING LOW NOTE]
Okay.
好

00:03:14.493 --> 00:03:16.625
Okay! That's enough!
好了 够了

00:03:16.669 --> 00:03:17.887
[SIGHS]

00:03:17.931 --> 00:03:19.933
I don't see why the kids
need their own shells.
我不懂为什么小孩需要自己的贝壳

00:03:19.976 --> 00:03:22.152
So if anyone gets in trouble,
we can call the others.
这样如果有人碰到麻烦就能互相通知

00:03:22.196 --> 00:03:25.112
Wait, you're saying
we should split up?
等一下 你说我们要分开

00:03:25.155 --> 00:03:28.289
We can try more paths
at once. It's the
fastest way through.
我们可以一次多试几条路

00:03:28.333 --> 00:03:30.900
Croods stick together.
Your way isn't safe.
古鲁家族不分开 你的方法不安全

00:03:30.944 --> 00:03:32.075
They can handle it.
他们应付得来的

00:03:32.119 --> 00:03:33.468
We can do it, Dad.
我们做得到的 老爸

00:03:33.512 --> 00:03:35.252
No, no, no.
不可以...我不准

00:03:35.296 --> 00:03:37.429
It's my job
to keep you safe.
我的责任是要确保你们的安全

00:03:37.472 --> 00:03:40.823
I'm still in charge
and we are not splitting up.
发号施令的还是我 我们不分开

00:03:41.433 --> 00:03:42.564
Except for you two.
除了你们两个

00:03:43.348 --> 00:03:44.653
And that's final.
就这样决定了

00:03:44.697 --> 00:03:45.785
[GRUNTS]

00:03:48.265 --> 00:03:49.484
[ALL SCREAMING]

00:03:55.882 --> 00:03:57.405
[ALL GRUNTING]

00:04:04.369 --> 00:04:06.066
[PANTING] Hello?
你们在哪

00:04:06.109 --> 00:04:08.242
Is everyone all right? Ah!
大家都还好吗

00:04:08.285 --> 00:04:09.591
UGGA: We're okay, Grug.
我们没事 咕噜

00:04:09.635 --> 00:04:11.898
Dad? I'm freaking
out a little bit.
老爸 我有点吓坏了

00:04:11.941 --> 00:04:14.553
Just tell me what to do.
What do I do?
What do I do right now?
我要做什么 我现在怎么办

00:04:14.596 --> 00:04:16.642
Stay where you are.
I'll find you.
留在原地不要动 我去找你

00:04:16.685 --> 00:04:18.426
No. Too slow.
不 这样太慢了

00:04:18.470 --> 00:04:21.429
Everybody,
keep moving forward
and we'll get out.
大家继续往前走 我们就会出去了

00:04:21.473 --> 00:04:22.474
THUNK: Dad?
[GRUNTS]
老爸

00:04:24.476 --> 00:04:26.129
Yeah.
对

00:04:26.173 --> 00:04:27.696
Okay.
好吧

00:04:27.740 --> 00:04:30.307
Remember,
never not be afraid.
绝对记得要害怕喔

00:04:30.351 --> 00:04:32.397
GUY: You can do this!
你做得到的

00:04:32.440 --> 00:04:34.703
It's going to be okay,
it's going to be okay.
一切都会没事的 一切都会没事的

00:04:34.747 --> 00:04:36.836
I'm going to pass out.
我要昏倒了

00:04:38.577 --> 00:04:40.448
[COOING]
Sandy. Sandy!
珊蒂 珊蒂

00:04:53.418 --> 00:04:54.419
[GASPS]

00:04:58.161 --> 00:04:59.554
[ALL GASP]
Oh.

00:05:03.123 --> 00:05:04.124
[GASPS]

00:05:12.698 --> 00:05:13.829
[SOBBING]

00:05:14.961 --> 00:05:15.962
Ah!

00:05:18.617 --> 00:05:19.618
[GASPS]

00:05:23.535 --> 00:05:25.319
[GROWLS]
[GROANS]

00:05:50.257 --> 00:05:51.345
[SNIFFS]

00:05:53.216 --> 00:05:54.391
[PANTING]

00:05:57.569 --> 00:05:58.657
[GROANS]

00:05:59.005 --> 00:06:00.267
[COOS]

00:06:03.749 --> 00:06:05.054
[SANDY COOING]

00:06:06.752 --> 00:06:08.144
Ah! Ooh...

00:06:12.279 --> 00:06:13.410
[MOANS]

00:06:15.456 --> 00:06:16.588
[GASPS]

00:06:18.764 --> 00:06:20.200
[YELPS]

00:06:20.243 --> 00:06:21.375
[BARKING]

00:06:24.421 --> 00:06:25.553
[YELPS]

00:06:30.210 --> 00:06:31.820
[WHISPERS]
Give me another one.

00:06:35.432 --> 00:06:36.738
You dropped these.
Whoa, whoa, whoa...
你掉了这个

00:06:38.914 --> 00:06:40.263
[CHUCKLES]

00:06:41.917 --> 00:06:43.092
[BLOWS]

00:06:44.441 --> 00:06:45.617
[GRUNTING]

